    "The stale static-publish test is replaced with coverage of current V5 behavior, including pre-mutation failure, switch-started error, proven rollback, uncertain switch/rollback, no false SUCCESS, and INSTALLATION_UNCONFIRMED for unproven runtime state. No production runtime change is made unless a concrete defect is proven.",
    "Reconciliation obtains only contents:read, actions:read and deployments:read; its concrete GitHub reads are tested against the repository/Deployments endpoints. No write permission is added.",
    "An empty production Deployment inventory remains NOT_DEPLOYED, with no installed SHA, no READY state, no successful deployment, and no inferred V5 production installation.",
    "Run all applicable exact local CLI and test commands from the current gpoint-prepare.yml before publication; validate source identity, imports, Node/Python syntax, workflow YAML and authorization. No GHCR or production mutations occur locally.",
