    "Only one clean fast-forward main publication and its canonical push-triggered Prepare are allowed. Failed local gate means no publication; failed Prepare means no GHCR publication beyond what Prepare actually reached, no Deploy and no blind rerun.",
    "After a successful Prepare, the existing controller may proceed only under this authorization and all exact provenance, OCI readback, security, migration, backup, rollback, lock, VPS and health gates. GitHub Deployment success and authorization consumption require independently verified post-Apply VPS evidence."
